  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fact-finding mission in Georgia on Waste and Chemicals Management</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fact-finding mission in Georgia on Waste and Chemicals Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r unders&#xf6;kningsuppdraget &#xe4;r att bed&#xf6;ma den nuvarande institutionella uppbyggnaden av avfalls- och kemikaliehanteringssektorerna i Georgien och ge konkreta rekommendationer f&#xf6;r ytterligare tekniska, institutionella, r&#xe4;ttsliga och kapacitetsm&#xe4;ssiga behov och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the fact-finding mission is to assess the current institutional setup of waste and chemicals management sectors in Georgia and provide concrete recommendations for further technical, institution, legal and capacity needs, and improvements.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fact-finding mission will comprehensively analyze the waste (covering municipal,
hazardous, and construction) and the chemicals management sectors. It will examine the
existing gaps and bottlenecks  institutional, legal, and capacity-related that prevent the
country to progress towards a sustainable waste and chemicals management system
aligned with the EU regulations and standards.</narrative>
  </description>
